IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bnra-types`
IMPORT `bnra-part1`

-- Tests for Part 1 (ss 2 to 4).  Every expectation is read off the text of the section
-- or paragraph named beside it.  Positional construction with OF; the ruler above each
-- block names the columns.

§ `Tests -- Part 1`

§§ `2(1) "business"`

--                                          trade/commerce/profession, other activity, for gain, office/employment/occupation
`a trade carried on for gain` MEANS `Business Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`another activity carried on for gain` MEANS `Business Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a trade not carried on for gain` MEANS `Business Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`an employment for gain` MEANS `Business Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE
`no activity at all` MEANS `Business Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE

#ASSERT `the activity is a business` `a trade carried on for gain`
#ASSERT `the activity is a business` `another activity carried on for gain`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is a business` `a trade not carried on for gain`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is a business` `an employment for gain`
#ASSERT NOT `the activity is a business` `no activity at all`

§§ `2(1) "individual"`

--                                       natural person, administrator etc, donee or deputy, direct control
`a natural person` MEANS `Individual Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`an executor with direct control` MEANS `Individual Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE
`an executor without direct control` MEANS `Individual Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`a deputy with direct control` MEANS `Individual Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE
`a stranger` MEANS `Individual Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the person is an individual` `a natural person`
#ASSERT `the person is an individual` `an executor with direct control`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an individual` `an executor without direct control`
#ASSERT `the person is an individual` `a deputy with direct control`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an individual` `a stranger`

§§ `2(1) "corporation" and "firm"`

--                                body corporate, company, LLP, foreign company
`a body corporate` MEANS `Corporation Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a company` MEANS `Corporation Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`a limited liability partnership` MEANS `Corporation Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`a foreign company` MEANS `Corporation Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`not a corporation` MEANS `Corporation Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the body is a corporation` `a body corporate`
#ASSERT `the body is a corporation` `a company`
#ASSERT `the body is a corporation` `a limited liability partnership`
#ASSERT `the body is a corporation` `a foreign company`
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a corporation` `not a corporation`

--                                    unincorporated, in partnership for profit, individuals, corporations
`two individuals in partnership` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  2, 0
`one individual alone` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  1, 0
`an individual and a corporation` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  1, 1
`two corporations` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  0, 2
`one corporation alone` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  0, 1
`two individuals who are incorporated` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  2, 0
`two individuals not in partnership for profit` MEANS `Firm Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, 2, 0

#ASSERT `the body is a firm` `two individuals in partnership`
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` `one individual alone`
#ASSERT `the body is a firm` `an individual and a corporation`
#ASSERT `the body is a firm` `two corporations`
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` `one corporation alone`
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` `two individuals who are incorporated`
#ASSERT NOT `the body is a firm` `two individuals not in partnership for profit`

§§ `2(1) "contact address" and "full name"`

--                               physical address, post office box, same jurisdiction as residence
`a proper contact address` MEANS `Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE
`a post office box` MEANS `Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE
`an address in another jurisdiction` MEANS `Contact Address Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`an address where no one can be found` MEANS `Contact Address Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE

#ASSERT `the address is a contact address` `a proper contact address`
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` `a post office box`
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` `an address in another jurisdiction`
#ASSERT NOT `the address is a contact address` `an address where no one can be found`

--                                registered under NRA, name on latest identity card, name on latest passport
`a resident with an identity card` MEANS `Full Name Facts` OF TRUE,  "TAN AH KOW", "TAN A K"
`a foreigner with a passport` MEANS `Full Name Facts` OF FALSE, "TAN AH KOW", "ALICE JANE SMITH"

#ASSERT `the individual's full name` `a resident with an identity card` EQUALS "TAN AH KOW"
#ASSERT `the individual's full name` `a foreigner with a passport` EQUALS "ALICE JANE SMITH"

§§ `2(2) and (3). Carrying on business in Singapore`

-- Business Presence Facts: place of business, otherwise carries on, foreign company, then
-- activities (a) party to a suit, (b) internal meetings, (c) bank account, (d) independent
-- contractor, (e) orders accepted abroad, (f) evidence of debt or charge, (g) collects debts,
-- (h) isolated 31-day transaction, (i) invests or holds property, (j) share office, (k) MAS
-- related corporation, (l) prescribed activity, then another reason.
`a local company with a shop` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a foreign company that only keeps a bank account` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a foreign company with a share transfer office and nothing else` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a foreign company with a share transfer office and a shop` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`a foreign company with a branch office` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a local company that only keeps a bank account but has an office` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a person who trades from a stall without a fixed place` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a foreign company with a place of business and only a 31-day isolated transaction` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`nothing in Singapore` MEANS `Business Presence Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a local company with a shop`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a foreign company that only keeps a bank account`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a foreign company with a share transfer office and nothing else`
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a foreign company with a share transfer office and a shop`
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a foreign company with a branch office`
-- s 2(3) is about foreign companies only
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a local company that only keeps a bank account but has an office`
#ASSERT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a person who trades from a stall without a fixed place`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `a foreign company with a place of business and only a 31-day isolated transaction`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as carrying on business in Singapore` `nothing in Singapore`
#ASSERT `the foreign company does any of the activities in section 2(3)(a) to (l)` `a foreign company that only keeps a bank account`
#ASSERT NOT `the foreign company does any of the activities in section 2(3)(a) to (l)` `a foreign company with a branch office`

§§ `4. Persons not required to be registered under Act`

-- Exemption Facts, column by column: (a) sole proprietor under own name, (b) firm under
-- full names, (c) profession, regulations remove (c), (d) nominee with particulars,
-- (e) statutory body, (f) Income Tax Act First Schedule, (g) society, (h) co-operative,
-- (i) mutual benefit organisation, (j) trade union, (ja) platform work association,
-- (k) Public Trustee, (l) foreign company under registered name, (m) company under corporate
-- name, (n) LLP under registered name, (o) limited partnership, s 42(3) LPA removes (o),
-- (p) exempted by the Minister, (q) old First Schedule sole proprietor.
`exempt as a sole proprietor under own name` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a firm under the partners' names` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a qualified profession` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a qualified profession that regulations remove` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a nominee's principal` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a statutory body` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as an Income Tax Act First Schedule body` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a society` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a co-operative` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a mutual benefit organisation` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a trade union` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a platform work association` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as the Public Trustee` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a foreign company under its registered name` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a company under its corporate name` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as an LLP under its registered name` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`exempt as a limited partnership` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a limited partnership that section 42(3) removes` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , TRUE , FALSE, FALSE
`exempt by the Minister's regulations` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE , FALSE
`exempt as an old First Schedule sole proprietor` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE 
`not exempt` MEANS `Exemption Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a sole proprietor under own name`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a firm under the partners' names`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a qualified profession`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `a qualified profession that regulations remove`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a nominee's principal`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a statutory body`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as an Income Tax Act First Schedule body`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a society`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a co-operative`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a mutual benefit organisation`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a trade union`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a platform work association`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as the Public Trustee`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a foreign company under its registered name`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a company under its corporate name`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as an LLP under its registered name`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as a limited partnership`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `a limited partnership that section 42(3) removes`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt by the Minister's regulations`
#ASSERT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `exempt as an old First Schedule sole proprietor`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is not required to be registered under section 4(1)` `not exempt`

-- s 4(1) exempts a person "when carrying on business in Singapore": required to register
-- means carrying on business and not exempt.
#ASSERT `the person is required to be registered` TRUE `not exempt`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to be registered` FALSE `not exempt`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a company under its corporate name`

-- s 4(3): a person not required to register may choose to, except those in (e) to (o)
#ASSERT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a sole proprietor under own name`
#ASSERT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a firm under the partners' names`
#ASSERT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a nominee's principal`
#ASSERT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt by the Minister's regulations`
#ASSERT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as an old First Schedule sole proprietor`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a statutory body`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a society`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a platform work association`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a company under its corporate name`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `exempt as a limited partnership`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` TRUE `not exempt`
#ASSERT NOT `the person may choose to be registered` FALSE `exempt as a sole proprietor under own name`

-- s 4(4)
#ASSERT `the person is subject to and must comply with the Act` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is subject to and must comply with the Act` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is subject to and must comply with the Act` FALSE TRUE
